{
  "title": "Warm Smoky Polish Mushroom Casserole",
  "description": "A hearty, earthy Polish dish featuring mushrooms and a smoky flavor, perfect for a family dinner. This low-sodium casserole is kid-friendly and served in individual ramekins.",
  "cuisine": "Polish",
